<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16455" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀστᾰφίς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίδος</span>,
			ἡ, sg. as collect. noun, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>dried grapes, raisins,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				5(1).1.13
			</span></i> (Tegea, <span class="entity">v B.C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.40
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Alex.
				127.4
			</span></i>, etc.: pl., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ Ῥόδος ἀσταφίδας
				[παρέχει</span>] <i><span class="en">
				Hermipp.
				63.16
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				4.4.9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				595b10
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀσταφίδος οἶνος</span>
			<i>raisin</i>-wine, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				845b
			</span></i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀστᾰφίς</span></b> ,
				v.l. ap.<i><span class="en">
				Phot.
			</span></i> as in <i><span class="en">
				Cratin.
				121
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				Nicopho
				21
			</span></i>; <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στᾰφίς</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Acut.</u>
				64
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				27.9
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σταφὶς ἀγρία</span>
			, Ps.-<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				4.152
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				11.842
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plin.
				<u>HN</u>
				23.17
			</span></i>. (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀσταφίς</span> is prob. by
			assimilation from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀσταφίς</span>; cf.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀστακός.</span>)</div>
